        <mxCell id="F73IZJWYlyAPoJfk7iDi-73" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=15;spacingTop=5;" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:18px;&quot;&gt;◆ Radiant warmer with functioning heat source &lt;b&gt;(ISOLETTE)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;◆ Oxygen source&lt;br&gt;◆ Suction equipment &lt;b&gt;(bulb syringe)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;◆ Bag-mask ventilation device&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;i&gt;(T-piece resuscitator preferred, self-inflating bag as backup)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;◆ Pulse oximeter with neonatal probe&lt;br&gt;◆ Warmed blankets/towels for drying&lt;br&gt;◆ Umbilical catheter tray&lt;br&gt;◆ Medications and Airway neonatal kit&lt;br&gt;◆ Panda Resuscitator&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
